WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:09.300
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.300 --> 00:11.100
(children)
Aye, aye, Captain!
（儿童）
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.100 --> 00:12.567
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:12.567 --> 00:14.567
(children)
Aye, aye, Captain!
（儿童）
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.567 --> 00:17.400
Oh...
哦...

00:17.400 --> 00:19.633
Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea?
谁住在菠萝里
在海底？

00:19.633 --> 00:21.633
(children)
SpongeBob SquarePants!
（儿童）
海绵宝宝！

00:21.633 --> 00:23.700
Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he
吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的

00:23.700 --> 00:25.367
(children)
SpongeBob SquarePants!
（儿童）
海绵宝宝！

00:25.367 --> 00:27.633
If nautical nonsense
be something you wish
如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西

00:27.633 --> 00:29.200
(children)
SpongeBob SquarePants!
（儿童）
海绵宝宝！

00:29.200 --> 00:31.867
Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish
然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通

00:31.867 --> 00:33.600
- SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
- 海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.600 --> 00:35.833
(all)
SpongeBob SquarePants!
（全部）
海绵宝宝！

00:35.833 --> 00:37.767
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.767 --> 00:39.733
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.733 --> 00:40.967
SpongeBob
海绵宝宝

00:40.967 --> 00:43.067
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:43.067 --> 00:45.733
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.733 --> 00:47.800
[piccolo melody]
[短笛旋律]

00:47.800 --> 00:49.300
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.267 --> 00:56.067
[upbeat ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

00:56.067 --> 01:02.067
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:03.800 --> 01:07.467
[rooster crows]
[公鸡打鸣]

01:07.467 --> 01:11.400
[Squidward hums]
[章鱼哥哼哼]

01:13.833 --> 01:15.233
Aah.
啊。

01:15.233 --> 01:19.067
Wow, 20 minutes in the bath
is probably enough.
哇，洗澡20分钟
可能就足够了。

01:21.133 --> 01:25.300
Aah, another day...
啊啊，改天了……

01:25.300 --> 01:27.900
Another day.
又一天。

01:27.900 --> 01:30.100
[snoring]
[打鼾]

01:30.100 --> 01:31.433
[fog horn]
[雾号]

01:31.433 --> 01:34.500
(SpongeBob)
Whoa! Oh, doh, ow, oh, ow, aah!
（海绵宝宝）
哇！噢，噢，噢，噢，噢，啊！

01:34.500 --> 01:36.467
[shower runs]
[淋浴运行]

01:36.467 --> 01:38.567
Ow, whoa, oof, ow!
噢，哇，噢，噢！

01:38.567 --> 01:42.200
Ready for work.
准备工作了。

01:42.200 --> 01:44.067
Oh, morning, Squidward! I--
哦，早上好，章鱼哥！我 -

01:47.400 --> 01:49.533
Oh! Not ready for work!
哦！还没准备好上班！

01:49.533 --> 01:52.967
Doh, oof, ow, ow, ooh!
噢，噢，噢，噢，噢！

01:52.967 --> 01:55.200
Whatever.
任何。

01:55.200 --> 01:58.067
- Thanks for waiting, Squidward.
- I wasn't waiting.
- 谢谢你的等待，章鱼哥。
- 我没等。

01:58.067 --> 02:01.333
[laughs] I was in such a hurry
I almost forgot my pants.
[笑]我太着急了
我差点忘记穿裤子了。

02:01.333 --> 02:04.067
- Yes, I saw that.
- I guess I was in a panic.
- 是的，我看到了。
- 我想我当时很恐慌。

02:04.067 --> 02:05.567
I mean, I can't believe we're
running so late for work,
我的意思是，我不敢相信我们
上班这么晚了

02:05.567 --> 02:06.733
can you? Huh, Squidward?
Can you believe it?
你可以吗？哈，章鱼哥？
你能相信吗？

02:06.733 --> 02:08.467
Are you panicking too?
你也惊慌失措吗？

02:08.467 --> 02:09.867
Late for work, late for work,
we're running late for work,
上班迟到，上班迟到，
我们上班要迟到了

02:09.867 --> 02:11.333
right?
正确的？

02:11.333 --> 02:13.600
Right. We're going to be there
15 minutes early.
正确的。我们会去那里
提前15分钟。

02:13.600 --> 02:16.267
I know! Only 15 minutes early?
我知道！只提前15分钟？

02:16.267 --> 02:20.067
Maybe we should take a shortcut.
也许我们应该走捷径。

02:20.067 --> 02:22.167
[gasps]
Squidward, what are you doing?
[喘气]
章鱼哥，你在做什么？

02:22.167 --> 02:25.633
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:27.667 --> 02:31.067
- Ugh...
- SpongeBob, look.
- 呃...
- 海绵宝宝，看。

02:31.067 --> 02:34.533
(Squidward)
We're walking
in a straight line.
（章鱼哥）
我们走着
在一条直线上。

02:34.533 --> 02:36.133
I don't follow.
我不跟。

02:36.133 --> 02:39.967
A straight line is the shortest
distance between any two points.
直线是最短的
任意两点之间的距离。

02:39.967 --> 02:42.733
Speak English, brainiac.
[laughs]
说英语，脑残。
[笑]

02:42.733 --> 02:46.567
Well, see, you have point A,
where you start,
好吧，看，你有A点，
从哪里开始，

02:46.567 --> 02:51.133
and then there's point,
uh, point, uh...
然后还有一点，
呃，重点，呃……

02:51.133 --> 02:55.133
I don't even know
what I'm talking about.
我什至不知道
我在说什么。

02:55.133 --> 02:57.567
Mmm, strawberry.
嗯，草莓。

03:00.533 --> 03:02.267
Tick!
打钩！

03:02.267 --> 03:06.067
Oh no! Now we're only going to
be 14 minutes early for work.
哦不！现在我们只需要
提前 14 分钟上班。

03:06.067 --> 03:08.300
Oh, there's got to be a shortcut
around here somewhere.
哦，总得有个捷径吧
就在这附近的某个地方。

03:08.300 --> 03:11.700
Oh, for the last time.
Straight line, point A.
哦，最后一次。
直线，A点。

03:11.700 --> 03:13.400
There's no shortcut.
没有捷径。

03:13.400 --> 03:15.900
There is always a shortcut.
总有捷径。

03:15.900 --> 03:19.800
What moron told you that?
哪个白痴告诉你的？

03:19.800 --> 03:21.867
There's always a shortcut.
总有一条捷径。

03:21.867 --> 03:23.200
Ah.
啊。

03:23.200 --> 03:25.467
Squidward, I am going to find
that shortcut.
章鱼哥，我要找到
那个捷径。

03:25.467 --> 03:30.167
Look, the Krusty Krab is right
at the end of the block.
看，蟹堡王说得对
在块的末尾。

03:30.167 --> 03:31.600
Yoo hoo!
哟吼！

03:31.600 --> 03:33.167
[gasps] You're not going
to come with me?
[喘气]你不会去
跟我一起去吗？

03:33.167 --> 03:36.333
No, SpongeBob. I'm just going
to struggle through
不，海绵宝宝。我正要去
去奋斗

03:36.333 --> 03:39.067
the rest of this walk alone.
剩下的路就一个人走。

03:39.067 --> 03:41.833
Well, I guess this is
where we part ways.
嗯，我想这就是
我们分道扬镳的地方。

03:41.833 --> 03:43.867
But I can't wait to see
your face when you get to work
但我已经等不及要看
当你上班时你的脸

03:43.867 --> 03:46.067
and I'm already there.
我已经在那里了。

03:46.067 --> 03:48.700
[laughs] That's the face!
That's the look!
[笑]这就是脸！
就是这个样子！

03:48.700 --> 03:51.933
[SpongeBob laughs]
[海绵宝宝笑]

03:51.933 --> 03:55.267
* First you do a zig,
then you take a little zag. *
* 首先你做一个之字形，
然后你稍微弯曲一下。 *

03:55.267 --> 03:57.533
* That's how you find
a shortcut. *
* 这就是你找到的方式
一条捷径。 *

03:57.533 --> 04:01.967
* Crawl underneath a fence,
struggle through a bush, *
*爬到栅栏下面，
挣扎着穿过灌木丛，*

04:01.967 --> 04:06.833
* and that's how you find
a shortcut. *
* 这就是你找到的方式
一条捷径。 *

04:06.833 --> 04:08.467
- Huh?
- Straight line.
- 啊？
- 直线。

04:08.467 --> 04:12.567
Point A to point B.
You're still not getting it.
A点到B点。
你还是没明白。

04:12.567 --> 04:16.433
Oh, tartar sauce. Maybe I should
have zagged when I zigged.
哦，塔塔酱。也许我应该
当我曲折时，已经曲折了。

04:16.433 --> 04:19.500
*First you do a zag,
crawl underneath a fence *
*首先你做一个曲折，
爬到栅栏下面*

04:19.500 --> 04:23.533
* Then you take a little zig,
that's how you find a shortcut *
* 然后你稍微弯曲一下，
这就是你找到捷径的方法*

04:23.533 --> 04:26.233
[laughs]
There, that's better.
[笑]
在那里，这样更好。

04:26.233 --> 04:27.567
[wolf howls]
[狼嚎]

04:27.567 --> 04:29.067
Oh. [nervous laugh]
哦。 [紧张的笑声]

04:29.067 --> 04:32.400
Now this is what I call
a real great shortcut.
现在这就是我所说的
一个真正伟大的捷径。

04:32.400 --> 04:34.667
Now all I have to do is remember
my wilderness training
现在我要做的就是记住
我的荒野训练

04:34.667 --> 04:36.967
so I don't get lost.
所以我不会迷路。

04:36.967 --> 04:40.167
The first rule of wilderness
training is map out your course
荒野第一法则
培训是规划你的课程

04:40.167 --> 04:43.500
by taking note
of local landmarks.
通过记下
当地地标。

04:43.500 --> 04:47.300
Local landmarks.
当地地标。

04:50.067 --> 04:51.667
Ah-hah!
啊哈！

04:51.667 --> 04:56.533
Right at this large,
unusual shell.
就这么大，
不寻常的外壳。

04:56.533 --> 04:59.300
Right at this abandoned sofa.
就在这个废弃的沙发旁边。

04:59.300 --> 05:02.967
And jog left
at the broken fire hydrant.
然后向左慢跑
在破损的消防栓处。

05:02.967 --> 05:04.933
[laughs]
[笑]

05:04.933 --> 05:06.867
There it is. The Krusty Krab.
就在那里。蟹堡王。

05:06.867 --> 05:10.933
Ooh!
[panting]
哦！
[气喘吁吁]

05:10.933 --> 05:12.933
[crash]
[碰撞]

05:12.933 --> 05:16.733
[slow Hawaiian-style music]
【缓慢的夏威夷风格音乐】

05:16.733 --> 05:21.833
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:23.533 --> 05:25.400
Aah.
啊。

05:25.400 --> 05:27.867
Well, look at this.
Lazin' about.
好吧，看看这个。
偷懒了。

05:27.867 --> 05:30.400
Can I get you anything else?
Another pillow maybe?
我还能给你找点别的吗？
也许另一个枕头？

05:30.400 --> 05:32.067
A cappuccino machine?
卡布奇诺咖啡机？

05:32.067 --> 05:33.433
No, thanks, I got one.
不，谢谢，我有一个。

05:33.433 --> 05:37.100
[whistles]
[口哨声]

05:37.100 --> 05:40.967
Perfect. No customers,
no SpongeBob.
完美的。没有顾客，
没有海绵宝宝。

05:40.967 --> 05:44.900
Oh, for kelp's sake.
You're a lost cause.
哦，为了海带。
你是一个失败的事业。

05:47.400 --> 05:49.067
[choir sings]
[合唱团唱歌]

05:49.067 --> 05:53.067
[gasps] The Krabby Krust?
[喘气]蟹堡？

05:54.433 --> 05:55.700
Is that the name
of a restaurant?
是这个名字吗
一家餐馆的？

05:55.700 --> 05:57.333
No, it's a typo.
不，这是一个错字。

05:57.333 --> 05:58.667
Could you perhaps tell me
你能告诉我吗

05:58.667 --> 06:00.733
how to get to
the Krusty Krab from here?
怎么去
蟹堡王是这里的吗？

06:00.733 --> 06:03.133
- Never heard of it.
- Oh, you should try it.
- 从来没有听说过。
- 哦，你应该尝试一下。

06:03.133 --> 06:05.967
It's the best place to eat
in all of Bikini Bottom.
这是最好的吃饭的地方
在所有比基尼底部。

06:05.967 --> 06:07.367
Here, take these coupons.
来，拿走这些优惠券。

06:07.367 --> 06:12.200
Thanks. I'm going to
go there right now.
谢谢。我要去
现在就去那里。

06:12.200 --> 06:14.600
I thought you didn't know
where the Krusty Krab was.
我以为你不知道
蟹堡王所在的地方。

06:14.600 --> 06:16.433
Oh, what do I do now?
哦，我现在该怎么办？

06:16.433 --> 06:18.933
[sobs]
[抽泣]

06:18.933 --> 06:22.067
Remember your landmarks.
记住你的地标。

06:22.067 --> 06:25.100
Sandy's wilderness tips
are always on the money.
桑迪的荒野小贴士
总是靠钱。

06:27.467 --> 06:31.167
Okay, let's see. I came from...
好吧，让我们看看。我来自...

06:31.167 --> 06:33.600
No, I came...
不，我来了……

06:33.600 --> 06:35.667
I'm lost!
我迷路了！

06:35.667 --> 06:36.933
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:36.933 --> 06:38.967
Hey, there's one
of my landmarks.
嘿，有一个
我的地标。

06:38.967 --> 06:42.167
The broken fire hydrant.
Hello, hydrant.
破损的消防栓。
你好，消火栓。

06:42.167 --> 06:46.667
I'm going to call you Heidi.
Heidi the hydrant.
我要叫你海蒂。
海蒂消防栓。

06:46.667 --> 06:51.267
So many broken fire hydrants.
What do I do now, Heidi?
这么多破损的消防栓。
我现在该怎么办，海蒂？

06:51.267 --> 06:55.233
If only I could telephone
Squidward, he'd help me out.
如果我能打电话就好了
章鱼哥，他会帮我的。

06:55.233 --> 06:59.533
Hey, that thing looks
kind of like a phone.
嘿，那东西看起来
有点像电话。

06:59.533 --> 07:01.433
Wow, this is weird.
哇，这很奇怪。

07:01.433 --> 07:05.700
It's like a phone,
but you put money in it.
就像电话一样，
但你把钱放进去。

07:05.700 --> 07:08.700
[change jingles]
[更改歌曲]

07:08.700 --> 07:11.633
My last dime.
我的最后一毛钱。

07:11.633 --> 07:13.633
I hope this works.
我希望这能起作用。

07:13.633 --> 07:16.133
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

07:16.133 --> 07:19.667
Krusty Krab,
may I reluctantly help you?
蟹堡王,
我可以勉强帮你吗？

07:19.667 --> 07:23.233
It's me, Squidward. SpongeBob.
I'm calling from a payphone.
是我，章鱼哥。海绵宝宝。
我用公用电话打电话。

07:23.233 --> 07:26.233
You don't say.
How's that shortcut of yours?
你不说。
你的那个捷径怎么样？

07:26.233 --> 07:29.200
Not good. I think I made a wrong
turn at the abandoned sofa.
不好。我想我做错了
转身看向废弃的沙发。

07:29.200 --> 07:30.833
All there is around here
are broken fire hydrants.
一切都在这附近
是损坏的消防栓。

07:30.833 --> 07:32.500
What should I do?
我应该怎么办？

07:32.500 --> 07:34.300
(phone operator)
If you'd like to continue
this call,
（电话接线员）
如果您想继续
这个电话，

07:34.300 --> 07:37.367
- please insert another dime.
- I don't have a dime.
- 请再插入一毛钱。
- 我一毛钱都没有。

07:37.367 --> 07:39.767
Operator, please, please,
can you tell me where I am?
接线员，请，请，
你能告诉我我在哪里吗？

07:39.767 --> 07:42.767
(operator)
If you'd like to know where you
are, please insert another dime.
（操作员）
如果你想知道你在哪里
是，请再插入一毛钱。

07:42.767 --> 07:45.067
Hold on!
坚持，稍等！

07:48.900 --> 07:50.733
[cell phone rings]
[手机响]

07:50.733 --> 07:53.333
Two nickels? I need a dime.
两镍币？我需要一毛钱。

07:53.333 --> 07:55.367
Oh, I'm never going
to get to work.
哦，我永远不会去
去上班。

07:55.367 --> 07:56.667
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

07:56.667 --> 07:57.867
Looking for a dime
in this abandoned sofa.
寻找一毛钱
在这个废弃的沙发里。

07:57.867 --> 08:01.367
This is our abandoned sofa, pal.
这是我们废弃的沙发，朋友。

08:03.067 --> 08:05.933
Whatcha doin' there,
drinking soda?
在那里做什么，
喝苏打水？

08:05.933 --> 08:07.233
What's it to ya?
关你什么事？

08:07.233 --> 08:08.633
Isn't a little early
to be hitting
是不是有点早了
被击中

08:08.633 --> 08:12.267
the high-fructose corn syrup?
高果糖玉米糖浆？

08:12.267 --> 08:13.667
Hey, listen.
嘿，听着。

08:13.667 --> 08:16.867
I know this gigantic soda
isn't good for me,
我知道这个巨大的苏打水
对我来说不好

08:16.867 --> 08:19.067
but sometimes it gives me
the kick I need
但有时它给了我
我需要的踢

08:19.067 --> 08:23.167
to start my busy day
as a pedicab driver.
开始我忙碌的一天
作为三轮车司机。

08:23.167 --> 08:25.400
Ooh, you drive a pedicab?
哦，你开三轮车吗？

08:25.400 --> 08:29.733
Yes, sir!
是的，先生！

08:29.733 --> 08:30.933
You need a ride somewhere?
您需要搭车去某个地方吗？

08:30.933 --> 08:34.767
Yes! To the Krusty Krab
and step on it!
是的！致蟹堡王
并踩在它上面！

08:34.767 --> 08:35.900
Way to go, Scott!
干得好，斯科特！

08:35.900 --> 08:37.300
Yeah, he's almost saved enough
是的，他已经攒够了

08:37.300 --> 08:41.200
to attend
a community college next year.
参加
明年是社区大学。

08:42.833 --> 08:47.767
Thanks a lot, Scott.
Stay in school.
非常感谢，斯科特。
留在学校。

08:47.767 --> 08:49.800
Krusty Klam? [gasps]
库斯蒂克拉姆？ [喘气]

08:49.800 --> 08:52.767
Wait, Scott. Come back!
等等，斯科特。回来！

08:52.767 --> 08:57.067
[gasps] Tartar sauce!
[喘气]塔塔酱！

09:00.833 --> 09:03.933
- Tock!
- No!
- 托克！
- 不！

09:03.933 --> 09:05.633
Over the cliff.
越过悬崖。

09:05.633 --> 09:07.333
Through the toxic runoff.
通过有毒径流。

09:07.333 --> 09:13.267
Make a right at the
disease-filled sewer pipe.
在
充满疾病的下水道。

09:13.267 --> 09:15.533
Face-first into this fetid muck.
脸朝下进入这片恶臭的淤泥。

09:15.533 --> 09:17.100
Over the garbage pile.
越过垃圾堆。

09:17.100 --> 09:20.167
Fall down this mountain
of broken glass.
掉下这座山
碎玻璃。

09:22.600 --> 09:25.833
Over the excruciatingly sharp
razor wire.
越过极其尖锐的
刀片刺网。

09:25.833 --> 09:29.233
[sputtering]
[溅射]

09:29.233 --> 09:32.567
Up this massive hill.
爬上这座巨大的山丘。

09:32.567 --> 09:35.500
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:37.600 --> 09:40.067
That's the Krusty Krab.
这就是蟹堡王。

09:40.067 --> 09:43.400
And I'm still two minutes early.
而且我还早了两分钟。

09:43.400 --> 09:45.867
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:45.867 --> 09:50.500
I made it. Oh, I made it.
我做到了。哦，我做到了。

09:50.500 --> 09:55.167
Oh, random Krusty Krab patrons,
how I've missed you.
噢，蟹堡王的随机顾客，
我多么想念你啊。

09:55.167 --> 09:59.400
Oh, how I've missed
your youthful faces.
哦，我多么怀念
你年轻的脸庞。

09:59.400 --> 10:01.600
I missed the bathroom, too.
[toilet flushing]
我也想念洗手间。
[冲厕所]

10:01.600 --> 10:04.133
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:04.133 --> 10:07.500
But most of all,
I missed you, choking guy.
但最重要的是，
我想念你，窒息的家伙。

10:09.833 --> 10:11.600
Patrick? How did you get here?
帕特里克？你是怎么到这里来的？

10:11.600 --> 10:13.233
Same way I always do.
我总是这样做。

10:13.233 --> 10:15.233
Scott gave me a ride
in his pedicab.
斯科特载我一程
在他的三轮车里。

10:15.233 --> 10:18.500
[bicycle horn squeaks]
[自行车喇叭吱吱作响]

10:18.500 --> 10:22.167
Squidward! Squidward,
can you believe I made it?
章鱼哥！章鱼哥，
你能相信我做到了吗？

10:22.167 --> 10:23.733
Oh.
哦。

10:23.733 --> 10:26.467
- Congratulations.
- What are you doing, boy?
- 恭喜。
- 你在做什么，男孩？

10:26.467 --> 10:30.333
You're scaring away all me
customers with your foul stench.
你吓跑了我所有人
顾客带着你的恶臭。

10:30.333 --> 10:31.967
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

10:31.967 --> 10:35.333
Oh, no, lad. You're not coming
in here looking like that.
哦，不，小伙子。你不来了
在这里看起来像那样。

10:35.333 --> 10:37.300
[fog horn]
[雾号]

10:37.300 --> 10:40.433
You're going straight home
for a nice, long bubble bath.
你直接回家
享受一个美好的、长时间的泡泡浴。

10:40.433 --> 10:41.700
Aye, aye, sir.
是啊，是啊，先生。

10:41.700 --> 10:44.533
What? He gets to go home
and take a bubble bath?
什么？他要回家了
并洗个泡泡浴？

10:44.533 --> 10:45.967
That's my thing.
那是我的事。

10:45.967 --> 10:47.400
Yes, it is.
是的。

10:47.400 --> 10:50.467
And consequently, you are
just neat as a pin.
因此，你是
就像别针一样整齐。

10:50.467 --> 10:52.733
Now get to work!
现在开始工作吧！

10:52.733 --> 10:56.067
I'm as neat as a pin.
我干净得像针一样。

10:56.067 --> 10:59.800
I'll show you neat as a pin.
我会告诉你整洁如针。

10:59.800 --> 11:04.467
[jabbering]
[叽叽喳喳]

11:12.067 --> 11:16.967
Where's my bubble bath,
Mr. Krabs?
我的泡泡浴在哪里
蟹老板？

11:16.967 --> 11:19.900
There you go.
就这样吧。

11:19.900 --> 11:22.067
Now get to work.
现在开始工作吧。

11:22.067 --> 11:26.067
Are you guys open?
I have coupons.
你们还开放吗？
我有优惠券。

11:26.067 --> 11:27.967
Buy one, get one free.
买一送一。

11:27.967 --> 11:31.767
Oh, no.
It says, "Buy one for a fee."
哦，不。
它说：“付费购买一个。”

11:31.767 --> 11:35.500
Oh. I stand corrected.
哦。我纠正了。

哦。我纠正了。